2	--
3	-- testbench for edge enhancement with FIR filter
4	-- reading and writing images in ppm-file format
5	--          ppm-file can be viewed with IrfanView and probably other image viewers
6	--          verified with IrfanView version 4.54 - 64 bit and 4.44 - 64 bit
7	--
8	-- FPGA Vision Remote Lab http://h-brs.de/fpga-vision-lab
